abstract: >-
  Single-page, client-side web application that plans drone mapping missions
  end to end: survey areas with photogrammetric or LiDAR grids, corridors,
  facades, orbits and inspection points, terrain following from a DEM,
  battery-sized block splitting, and export as KML or DJI WPML (KMZ) for
  DJI Pilot 2.
